//! All aspect traits, their identity functions, and `_get`/`_get_maybe`
//! helpers are generated by `build.rs::aspects()` into
//! `$OUT_DIR/gen_aspects.rs`. The generated trait names match what the old
//! `aspect!` macro produced (e.g. `AspectType`, `aspect_type_get`); add new
//! aspects in `build.rs`.
include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/gen_aspects.rs"));
